  aids her teammates by keeping them  stopped on loot and flanking enemies as  a distraction again these are just best  guesses based on trailers or teasers and  what data mining would suggest the  teleport is the only thing that has  solid evidence of being true though  again it hasn't yet been confirmed but  we'd love to hear from you or do you buy  into our theory or do you think Lobos  abilities are something else entirely  let us know in the comment section below  be sure to stay tuned to games but will  inform you of Lobos abilities when  they're officially announced as well as  everything else coming in season 5  fortunes favor  [Music]  you  [Music]
 

